<mxGraphModel adaptiveColors="auto">
  <root>
    <mxCell id="0"/>
    <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
    <mxCell id="t" value="Retry loop of one task: a worked example from wdf_workflow.taskpath and wdf_workflow.failures" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="a" value="Task sim: simulate, retries 1, checkpoint true, run_timeout_s 600, on pool table v0" style="swimlane;startSize=30;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="60" width="640" height="830" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="a0" value="&lt;b&gt;1. place, local activity, answer kept as a marker&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;wdf-simulate, 384Mi, schedule-to-start 1800 s, start-to-close 600 + 120 = 720 s, heartbeat 60 s; budgets guest 1, infra 10" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="a"><mxGeometry x="10" y="40" width="620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="a1" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Attempt 1 (r0a1): lost completion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;the worker beats checkpoint c1 and then is gone: heartbeat_timeout after 60 s, read from the last heartbeat. index_checkpoint(c1, r0a1), task.checkpoint.committed sequence 0, task.attempt.failed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="a"><mxGeometry x="10" y="138" width="620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="ae1" style="endArrow=block;html=1;" edge="1" parent="a" source="a0" target="a1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b&gt;3. decide: heartbeat_timeout is infra&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;infra 10 to 9, backoff 10 s on a workflow timer, kept checkpoints [c1]; wdf_workflow_retries_total{budget=infra} +1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="a"><mxGeometry x="10" y="236" width="620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="ae2" style="endArrow=block;html=1;" edge="1" parent="a" source="a1" target="a2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Attempt 2 (r0a2): no worker takes it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;schedule_to_start_timeout after 1800 s: free, re-place. place again with 1800 x 2 = 3600 s (ceiling 43200 s), reschedules 1, no budget consumed; wdf_workflow_reschedules_total +1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="a"><mxGeometry x="10" y="334" width="620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="ae3" style="endArrow=block;html=1;" edge="1" parent="a" source="a2" target="a3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="a4" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Attempt 3 (r0a3): starts from c1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;task.requested carries resume_checkpoint c1. The worker fails timeout with c3 in its failure details: index_checkpoint(c3, r0a3), task.checkpoint.committed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="a"><mxGeometry x="10" y="432" width="620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="ae4" style="endArrow=block;html=1;" edge="1" parent="a" source="a3" target="a4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="a5" value="&lt;b&gt;6. decide: timeout is guest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;guest 1 to 0, no backoff, kept checkpoints [c3, c1]. A second guest failure would end the task: paused, because its checkpoint flag is set (task.retries.exhausted)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="a"><mxGeometry x="10" y="530" width="620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="ae5" style="endArrow=block;html=1;" edge="1" parent="a" source="a4" target="a5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="a6" value="&lt;b&gt;7. Attempt 4 (r0a4): starts from c3 and succeeds&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;commit of r0a4 only: a zombie of r0a1 that completes late is refused by the server (NOT_FOUND) and never reaches the commit. task.started, task.succeeded, task.result.ready" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="a"><mxGeometry x="10" y="628" width="620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="ae6" style="endArrow=block;html=1;" edge="1" parent="a" source="a5" target="a6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="a7" value="&lt;b&gt;8. Status query&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;task_attempt 4, guest_left 0, infra_left 9, reschedules 1, last_class timeout, checkpoint c3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="a"><mxGeometry x="10" y="726" width="620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="ae7" style="endArrow=block;html=1;" edge="1" parent="a" source="a6" target="a7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="b" value="History events, measured on the dev server by test_history_shape" style="swimlane;startSize=30;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="60" width="520" height="570" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="b0" value="&lt;b&gt;Per job, task and retry (job v2 estimates 10, 8, 6)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;job 13&lt;br&gt;simulate task 15, compile task 27 (cache_lookup and cache_record add 3 each)&lt;br&gt;guest retry 9, infra retry 14 (its backoff timer adds TimerStarted, TimerFired and a workflow task)&lt;br&gt;every figure is above its estimate: a contract-change question on job v2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="b"><mxGeometry x="10" y="40" width="500" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="b1" value="&lt;b&gt;Placement down for an hour (D15)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;place retries at 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32 s in process, the workflow task heartbeated: 21 events over the first 63 s&lt;br&gt;then each backoff above the 60 s local retry threshold waits on a timer: 64, 128, 256, 512, 600, 600 s, 6 events each&lt;br&gt;one hour: 21 + 9 x 6 = 75 events, against about 1,350 if every retry stayed in process" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="b"><mxGeometry x="10" y="170" width="500" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="b2" value="&lt;b&gt;History budget (D16)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;the length is recorded as wdf_workflow_history_events at each wake&lt;br&gt;at max_history_events (10,000 on ci) no new task or attempt is placed, running tasks finish, and the job ends failed with history-budget: &amp;lt;length&amp;gt;; tasks never placed end cancelled" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="b"><mxGeometry x="10" y="310" width="500" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="b3" value="&lt;b&gt;Lost cached component (decision 10)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;a consumer of a compile cache hit fails ARTIFACT_LOST: cache_invalidate(key, lost component) once for all consumers, the compile runs its path again (a fresh entry of another job is still taken), then each consumer runs again with no budget charged&lt;br&gt;a second loss in the same run ends the task" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="b"><mxGeometry x="10" y="430" width="500" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
  </root>
</mxGraphModel>
